{"type":"compaction","id":"c375d37d","parentId":"31887c86","timestamp":"2026-10-06T23:52:57.713Z","summary":"## Goal\nComplete documentation PRs in **`21nCo/super-functions`** sequentially, preserving reviewed prerequisites and merging only fully assessed, applicable-green exact heads.\n\nRecurring authorization: **“proceed and dont stop until you take up one after the other.”** Latest user request: **“resume.”**\n\n**Current: #213, frozen head `f15540d26c2329203c626ccb51eb9108c5bebd84`, collection1/publication0.** Fresh hosted skill retrieval, authenticated exact clean checkout and the sole feedback/check collection succeeded. Assessment has only begun; primary-feedback reads were truncated. No #213 source mutation, candidate installation, verification, commit or push is shown.\n\n**#212 published once at `3c733afa29ffb7c721870a8d5318cf656f3f1ca4`, unmerged and stopped.** #206/#207/#209/#210/#211 also stopped. #208/#223/#229 merged; #133 parked; #222 protected.\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Hosted **`21n/pr-refetch-fix` v1.4.0 revision6**:\n  - Digest **`sha256:b6a6e7a8c670bc5ab12540910401d153e8eedd533d89fd1a1925bc9979112726`**, at **`data.version.digest`**.\n  - Instructions SHA-256 **`78e6b66300287085d26e1cf15657a5010c6c93d0c2c23a9d4240064a6cdcd91c`**.\n  - Fresh pin/read per new PR; #213 already retrieved and collection consumed.\n  - Preserve historical pre-use/read-visibility qualifications. Large tool reads remain truncated; written “complete reading” assertions do not independently prove full visible review.\n- One bounded round per PR: exact checkout, one collection, complete scoped assessment/verification, at most one integration/corrective commit and ordinary push, one immediate receipt, report and stop.\n  - No post-push feedback refetch, CI polling/retrigger, metadata retry, automatic stopped-PR revisit or whole-task convergence inferred from scoped passes.\n- Every `gh` command uses **`GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other`**, active account