reset before source mutation: invariant, faithful old boundary, coordinated ownership/failure plan, independent acceptance.\n  - Shared-family failed-round history/counters persist across products; unknown historical counts are not reset to zero.\n  - Immutable plans and later explicit supplements are separate evidence.\n- Preserve positives: `buildLlmsSiteArtifacts` canonicalUrl option **and returned value**, single dynamic normal/error titles, correct hints/config/sidebar/plugin typing/Node policy, native search/TopBar/mobile drawer, reduced motion, observer nonzero-height guard/disconnect, Vitest **`^3.2.4`**/3.x, SDK first-colon identities/`absolutePath`, server-owned full content, native `/docs/blog`, declared public dependency exports, six text extensions/native binary passthrough, Promise/rejection interfaces.\n- Controlled inputs/observers are excluded from publication and restored absent; temporary generated files restored byte/mode exact.\n  - **Historical noncanonical type fixtures are preserved, hashed and excluded—not deleted merely because their names begin `__`.**\n  - Legitimate tracked `__tests__` and `__init__.py` paths must not be excluded by broad substring checks.\n- Local/native/browser tests and offline dry-runs do not prove hosted-green readiness, live hosting/Worker execution, registry/native platform, backend durability/full SQL, OS IME, full Bun authentication or observer lifecycle.\n- Eight historical workers closed; no new delegation or `--ignore-other-worktrees`. Cubic unavailable; review-pattern skill read without fetched learnings.\n  - Aside entry requires **`aside guide`**; successfully executed during #212. Browser evidence uses recorded native Playwright harnesses.\n- R2, if relevant: personal u0/bucket-scoped credentials; no public access without direction.\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Original22-PR inventory/provenance consolidated; `21nCo/docs` had no open PRs. Eight workers closed;19 owned historical worktrees archived/remo