e(owner: URL, name: string)`; registry DB failures/11maps/489-map rejection and SQL/test evidence retained.\n  - Reviewed preparation base **`42a6d4536385c678ec76132f47ad13d2df0b9b93`**, aftera40/#234/#235:37paths/29maps, DB0.3/SecFn0.0.3/middleware0.3/FileFn0.2/OAuth/admin/registry/API changes. Not automatic docs clearance.\n- [x] Cleanup/SSD relocation completed and consumed:\n  -834 dependency dirs/17.116GiB, then167 exact historical dirs/4.486698GiB; sources/locks/logs/builds preserved.\n  - Two-tree byte/mode/ACL/xattr/directory/link/hardlink preservation; only proven-owned workers88957/90074/90588 stopped.\n  - `AttributeError: module 'os' has no attribute 'listxattr'` corrected using native libSystem; rsync23/70 proven transfer-created sidecar links handled under existing authority.\n- [x] #211 scoped evidence retained:\n  - Normal rootci unchanged lock `528e0c5a90d41d1baede5c121e9a1549067cbfad963b5a846937d74e4ab64ab2`, four closures, native DB/SecFn contracts, AuthFn28OpenAPI paths31operations, DataFn379-route Next/HTTP/offlineCF/localWorker.\n  - Full AuthFn `tsc --noEmit` exit2 unchanged broader42a/7bb baseline; #212 type passes do not retroactively clear it.\n  - Eight ghost routes from successful-empty bracketed Git pathspec oracle archived and corrected to exact membership absence; no general removal authority.\n  - Push reported940default-branch vulnerabilities76critical213high604moderate47low; not cleared.\n- [x] **#212 completed final native verification and review/capture work**:\n  - Original frozen0680/branch`codex/docs-devfn-20260926`;31threads8primary75original paths; JavaScript109924144190/run36726324845 and Sonar109925687700 failures frozen, not hosted-green.\n  - Original158-path plan immutable; explicit fiveAuthFnAI/fourexecuting config-generator/DevFnREADME/native-generated supplements.\n  - Corrected audit filename typo `producer-producer-final-generated-afterimages-amendment.json`→`producer-final-generated-afterimages-amendment.json`; capture passed.\n  - Final **8314canonical/8149outside-plan exact42a/165plan/128base changes/35focused maps**;121human paths,107exact provenance reuses and14novel paths/280lines.\n  - Written final source assessment records706-line lock review,1744-line generated amendment and1742-line frozen novel patch reads. **Many displayed tool results remain truncated; those complete-reading claims do not independently establish full visible review.** Historical pre-use/read-timing qualifications explicitly retained.\n  - Final six separate-process native Vite HTTP and two DevFn hydrated browser contexts passed again.\n  - Normal root npm10-ci scripts enabled, unchanged lock **`afe2b9c7db618ffbbb5c932a75baa5d404bf67689fcc31cfba3922546428938b`**.\n  - Six root zero-failure closures:DevFn323/AuthFn484/FileFn320/SecFnserver381/SecFncore480/FileFnserver379.\n  - Exactly three genuine contexts:DevFn ordinary npm11 install; AuthFn/FileFn independently retained own locks/installations. Three closure counts182/234/182, zero failures. Existing CliFn empty directories/configuration preserved.\n  - Latest six pristine builds/tests/full tsc/native Vite/native LLM preview; each46Vitest+2Node; actual CLI validation; six executing SDK-config/CLI origin matrices; two hydrated search/mobile/title boundaries passed locally.\n  - PUBLIC_ORIGIN only withDEPLOY=`\"1\"`; assets-only deployment matches normal; AuthFn/FileFn defaults `.com`; DevFn normal source-link fallback; twelve static files restored byte/mode exact.\n  - Actual docs first-colon/flat-index/Unicode/thinDTO/nativeBlog/RSS/drafts/source/text-binary boundaries, unknown package guard with10invalid shapes and valid admission checked;28controlled inputs/context and observers restored absent.\n  - OfflineCF dry-run/emitted Worker developmentpublic literals archived; not Worker execution or deployment.\n- [x] **#212 admission oracle failures corrected without cleanup**:\n  - `verify-final-promotion-admission.py` first failed on overbroad `__