requisite diagnostics classified stale; Sonar canonical concerns corrected, Promise async/static title requests invalid, unused import stale. New-head hosted gates unassessed.\n  - Collection1/commit1/push1/refetch0/poll0/threadmutation0/merge0. Written final findings/dispositions/source assessment/publication/termination; ledger/checkpoint/REPORT advanced213.\n- [x] **#213 fresh admission and sole collection**:\n  - Retrieved hosted pin via `/Users/serro/.local/bin/composio execute CUSTOM_SKILLPLANE_SKILL_RETRIEVE`; `successful:true`, noerror, exactdigest/revision6/version1.4.0/hash verified.\n  - Caller model fields remain `\"unknown\"` rather than invented; availablePIenvironment recorded separately.\n  - Read prior213ledger and skill in bounded reads; displayed responses truncated, so written complete-reading receipt remains visibility-qualified.\n  - Identity OPEN/noncross/base`dev`, branch **`codex/docs-extfn-20260926`**, head **`f15540d26c2329203c626ccb51eb9108c5bebd84`**.\n  - `admit-exact-checkout.py` fetched exact branch once, confirmed existing local branch, ordinary `git switch`; clean exactT, all protected bytes/modes/linktext unchanged; no worktree bypass/newroot/install.\n  - `git fetch origin dev` stored preparation SHA; **its value has not been displayed/read in this segment**.\n  - Persisted `current_sequential_round`, mode`architecture_reset_required`; emitted:\n    **`ARCHITECTURE_RESET_REQUIRED:docs.page-provider-path-and-payload`**\n    and **`ARCHITECTURE_RESET_REQUIRED:docs.consumer-conditional-runtime-ownership`**.\n  - Collection attempt admitted and count persisted1 before collector; collector exited0:\n    **56threads/22primary/85files**.\n  - Visible frozen checks: JavaScriptfailure, SonarCloudfailure; CodeQL/Socket/Python/release checks largelysuccess with some skips. Full check inventory tail and diagnostics not yet assessed.\n  - Began `primary.txt` reads1–180 and181–400; both tool outputs truncated.\n    - Visible `PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6mN