ent>The shared helper generates AuthFn and FileFn LLM links from their stale `*.superfunctions.dev` config URLs, but Cloudflare publishes them at `authfn.com` and `filefn.com`. Pass the deployment origin from those generators, or update the site canonical URLs before generating the artifacts.</comment>\n\n<file context>\n@@ -1,5 +1,38 @@\n+export async function buildLlmsSiteArtifacts(cwd, dependencies, options = {}) {\n+  const { config, manifest } = await loadLlmsSiteSource(cwd, dependencies);\n+  const { buildLlmsTxtArtifacts } = dependencies;\n+  const canonicalUrl = options.canonicalUrl ?? config.site?.canonicalUrl;\n+  const artifacts = buildLlmsTxtArtifacts(manifest, {\n+    canonicalUrl,\n</file context>\n```\n\n</details>\n\n✅ Addressed in [`f15540d`](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/commit/f15540d26c2329203c626ccb51eb9108c5bebd84)\n\n## PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6nPyrs scripts/docs-site/vitest.config.ts\n<!-- cubic:v=2e7d876d-23d5-4157-8880-5568b07d7823 -->\n<!-- cubic:review-run=23e7caba-debf-56a0-86b1-7698c944f64b -->\n<!-- metadata:{\"confidence\":9} -->\nP3: The guard's suggested command references `@botfn/docs`, but this repository has no `botfn/docs` workspace — the only consumer of this shared config is `@extfn/docs` (extfn/docs/package.json). A developer who triggers this error here and follows the suggestion would run a nonexistent workspace and get a failure with no guidance. Use `@extfn/docs` as the example.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Prompt for AI agents</summary>\n\n```text\nCheck if this issue is valid — if so, understand the root cause and fix it. At scripts/docs-site/vitest.config.ts, line 10:\n\n<comment>The guard's suggested command references `@botfn/docs`, but this repository has no `botfn/docs` workspace — the only consumer of this shared config is `@extfn/docs` (extfn/docs/package.json). A developer who triggers this error here and follows the suggestion would run a nonexistent workspace and get a failure with no guidance. Use `@extfn/docs` as the example.</comment>\n\n<file context>\n@@ -1,9 +1,16 @@\n+const sitePackagePath = resolve(process.cwd(), \"package.json\");\n+const sitePackage = JSON.parse(readFileSync(sitePackagePath, \"utf8\"));\n+if (!sitePackage.name?.endsWith(\"/docs\") || !sitePackage.dependencies?.[\"@docsfn/core\"]) {\n+  throw new Error(\"Run DocsFn site tests from a consuming docs workspace, for example npm test --workspace @botfn/docs\");\n+}\n+\n</file context>\n```\n\n</details>\n\n```suggestion\n  throw new Error(\"Run DocsFn site tests from a consuming docs workspace, for example npm test --workspace @extfn/docs\");\n```\n\n✅ Addressed in [`f15540d`](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/commit/f15540d26c2329203c626ccb51eb9108c5bebd84)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1791331140405}}
