ovenance composition of reviewed provider/page/blog/DTO helpers and every affected AuthFn/FileFn/ExtFn caller; original85 and reviewed42a prerequisite contracts preserved. Coordinate parser/control/text-binary/flat-index-Unicode identities and server-owned full content rather than symptom edits.\",\n      \"independent_acceptance\": \"Actual pinned provider/manifest/compiler links plus native root/three genuine contexts HTTP/hydration approved-key/private-marker oracles; server full-content positives, API/blog/RSS/draft/title, text/native binary, single-owner hydrated search/mobile/error title. Helper-only passes do not admit publication.\"\n    },\n    \"docs.consumer-conditional-runtime-ownership\": {\n      \"invariant\": \"Shared imports use each consumer's declared public ESM/subpath exports and one Svelte runtime, never root/sibling dependency borrowing, guessed CJS paths or universal externalization.\",\n      \"old_head_evidence\": \"frozen-native-ssr-owner-result.json: exact f155 runtime/plugin in isolated shared-source audit directory, native Vite6.4.3 SSR/loopback HTTP500 ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND gray-matter. Retained DevFn receiver has same frozenExt Core/Vite/parser declarations; audit negative only, not genuine213 acceptance. FrozenAuth/File omit direct parser declarations.\",\n      \"coordinated_plan\": \"Reviewed export-aware plugin/test/typing ownership with direct AuthFn/FileFn parser declarations and preserved ExtFn declaration; trace transitive AuthFn OAuth/observability OpenAPI peers. Archive/guard one SSD root and exactly3 existing slots/own locks; no fourth consumer or extra full root. Slot conversion requires distinct admission.\",\n      \"independent_acceptance\": \"Normal root npm10 ci scripts with admitted unchanged lock, genuine independently owned contexts, physical public-export/version closures, actual generators/CLI/full tsc/tests/builds/native Vite HTTP and single-owner browser. Distinguish Arborist/npm11/DNS/native/baseline failures; no212-to213 installation proof transfer.\"\n    },\n    \"docs.public-origin-propagation\": {\n      \"invariant\": \"Executing config/generator/public outputs use deployment-selected public origin independent of assets; cache hashes cover output roles and advertised /docs LLM endpoints actually resolve with coherent guides/corpus.\",\n      \"old_head_evidence\": \"frozen213-cache-result.json actual installed Turbo audits frozenT/config/inputs: Ext/Auth/File task hashes unchanged for distinct public origins, empty hashed env lists; no build/deployment executed. Missing AuthFn native /docs LLM route source inventory is captured, native HTTP reproduction pending.\",\n      \"coordinated_plan\": \"Coordinate actual configs/generators/deploy cache roles and native endpoints, preserve canonicalUrl option/returned value, fix FileFn AI host siblings and regenerate; no live domain/route/DNS/certificate/secret/Worker changes.\",\n      \"independent_acceptance\": \"Actual Turbo changed-role/repeat hashes plus native executing config/generator matrices and native endpoint bytes/content types/cache/freshness. Offline emitted literals do not prove live Worker execution; Windows fixture correction does not claim Windows execution.\"\n    },\n    \"docs.llms-artifact-publication\": {\n      \"invariant\": \"Per-file public pathname exposes complete old/new bytes; replacement failure preserves old bytes/owner mode, unique temp ownership, check mode nonwriting. No pair transaction or power-loss durability promise.\",\n      \"old_head_evidence\": \"old-native-artifact-reader-boundary.log: exact frozen writer in normal Node child on verified writable SSD; independent native public reader102 reads/9 empty-truncated violations; no mocked filesystem, source mutation or killed process.\",\n      \"coordinated_plan\": \"Exclusively created unique same-directory temp, full write/close then rename, existing-mode preservation, reject ambiguous symlink/nonregular targets, only owned temp cleanup on failure; preserve failure and shared generator callers.\",\n      \"independent_acceptance\": \"Native concurrent readers only complete old/new, mode/absent/repeat/nonwriting-check cases, controlled write/rename failure old-byte/owned-temp oracle and concurrent-temp isolation; no pair transaction/fsync claim.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"primary_pre_edit_assessment\": \"sequential-20261003T184612Z/PR-213/frozen-primary-assessment.md; 10Actionable9Stale3Invalid surfaces, 8deduplicated direct causes; no fixes applied\",\n  \"state\": \"Same frozen213 collection1/publication0. All22primary/34resolved bodies and 4364-line novel human patch now read untruncated; novel supplementary bodies read, historical exact reuse remains qualified. Four-field resets/native audit negatives recorded. Full generated/lock/canonical provenance/archive/source/native/staging gates still closed. Tclean exactf155; SSD root/3 genuine contexts remain212, no213 application/install proof inferred.\",\n  \"snapshot_threads\": 56,\n  \"snapshot_primary\": 22,\n  \"snapshot_original_paths\": 85,\n  \"checks\": {\n    \"success\": 30,\n    \"skipped\": 5,\n    \"failure\": 2\n  },\n  \"collection_receipt\": \"sequential-20261003T184612Z/PR-213/collection-receipt.json\",\n  \"collection_count\": 1,\n  \"publication_count\": 0,\n  \"completed\": false,\n  \"collection_attempt\": \"sequential-20261003T184612Z/PR-213/collection-attempt-start.json; attempt admitted, no automatic retry\",\n  \"prior_read_timing_qualifications\": \"Historical prior whole-review/pre-use assertions remain qualified; new round cannot retroactively validate them.\"\n}\nArtifacts:\nSKILL.md\nadmit-exact-checkout.py\nall-feedback.txt\nall-protected-before-switch.json\narchitecture-reset.md\nauth-context.log\ncheck-110232623425-annotations.json\ncheck-110232623625-annotations.json\ncheck-110232623649-annotations.json\ncheck-110232623684-annotations.json\ncheck-110232623713-annotations.json\ncheck-110232623830-annotations.json\nche