{"type":"message","id":"caae179a","parentId":"7207cd18","timestamp":"2026-10-07T04:34:32.841Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_c501be190734482b8825de11c2af0f49|fc_055fb762f51dfcfc016ac5cbd80fd087d0baa50b3db1e09e20","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"}\n```\n\nReturns the full markdown.\n\n### `get_route`\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"name\": \"get_route\",\n  \"description\": \"Look up an HTTP route by method + path\",\n  \"input_schema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"method\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"GET\", \"POST\", \"PUT\", \"DELETE\", \"PATCH\"] },\n      \"path\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\"method\", \"path\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nReturns the route's request schema, response schema, error codes, and a link to the docs page.\n\n### `get_error`\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"name\": \"get_error\",\n  \"description\": \"Look up an error code\",\n  \"input_schema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"code\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\"code\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nReturns the canonical message, HTTP status, and \"common causes\" / \"fixes\" prose.\n\n## See also\n\n- [llms.txt](./llms-txt) — static alternative.\n- [Skills](./skills) — pre-baked workflows.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1791347672841}}
