{"type":"message","id":"4f1cc080","parentId":"107d8f14","timestamp":"2026-10-07T05:49:41.533Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0c47ba291aff4318a2dfbe5c25bf5d90|fc_055fb762f51dfcfc016ac5dd6ec0f487d08dccfbdcc069f54f","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Aside guide prerequisite exit=0\n1:Aside CLI 1.26.916.1741 · Skill version 3\n5:Aside is an AI browser. Inside Aside, there is an intelligent agent designed to handle complex tasks across user's credentials, cookies, browsing history, and various websites the user uses.\n7:There are two ways of controlling Aside browser:\n18:After spawning the task, watch the run and give the user a status update around every 60 seconds.\n25:aside \"https://example.com\" # a link starts with http(s) opens website in user's browser screen\n52:Use this when you need to directly control tabs, inspect screenshot and DOM, and run JavaScript code on the browser.\n69:On `aside mcp`, prefer the `memory_search` tool instead of CLI command.\nfinal212-standalone-devfn-browser-exposed-point.receipt.json ['node', '/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/audits/sf-docs-review-20260930/sequential-20261003T184612Z/PR-212/verify-devfn-browser.mjs', '/Volumes/OS - Data/superfunctions-agent-storage/sf-docs-review-20260930/sequential-20261003T184612Z/PR-209/standalone-current-npm11']\nfinal212-root-devfn-browser.receipt.json ['node', '/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/audits/sf-docs-review-20260930/sequential-20261003T184612Z/PR-212/verify-devfn-browser.mjs', '/Volumes/OS - Data/superfunctions-agent-storage/sf-docs-review-20260930/sequential-20261003T184612Z/PR-209/verification-latest-base-root']\nfinal212-standalone-devfn-browser.receipt.json ['node', '/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/audits/sf-docs-review-20260930/sequential-20261003T184612Z/PR-212/verify-devfn-browser.mjs', '/Volumes/OS - Data/superfunctions-agent-storage/sf-docs-review-20260930/sequential-20261003T184612Z/PR-209/standalone-current-npm11']\nfinal212-root-devfn-browser-expo