{"type":"message","id":"d2e82aeb","parentId":"0a9f65d3","timestamp":"2026-10-07T05:58:20.091Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ef7cdcda324e4141b32953d6f193f9d2|fc_055fb762f51dfcfc016ac5df79cf6887d0abfa408c72ace9a8","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"extfn llms.txt 1958 stdMatches True footer ' Use the Promise-first browser facade, messaging, events, and capabilities.\\n- [Scan and package](https://extfn.com/docs/scan-and-package) — Interpret strict findings and produce extension archives.\\n'\nextfn llms-full.txt 27748 stdMatches True footer 'will pass in a deployed browser. Run the [example validation matrix](/docs/reference/cli) and inspect the generated manifest and [scan report contract](/docs/reference/scan) before distribution.\\n\\n---\\n'\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 5, in <module>\nUnicodeDecodeError: 'utf-8' codec can't decode byte 0x80 in position 0: invalid start byte\n\n\nCommand exited with code 1"}],"isError":true,"timestamp":1791352700091}}
