ion; new read receipts do not retroactively clear it. Four-field resets/pre-edit classifications remain:10Actionable/9Stale/3Invalid surfaces,8 direct causes; four faithful audit negatives, not native installed acceptance.\n  6 \n  7 ## Newly persisted\n  8 \n  9 - compose-reviewed-candidate.py -> immutable reviewed-candidate-plan.json:203paths/original85/35focused lock maps,117 initially changed entries, all8314retained212 canonical hashes/modes checked. All gates false; no application by this script.\n-10 - planned-novel-source-review.patch583lines, planned-focused-lock-maps.json1028lines, frozen-generated-vs-reviewed212.patch616lines, preserved-original213-human-pre-use.patch1248lines/36paths were visibly read through EOF in bounded calls without character truncation. Historical reuse qualifications remain.\n+14 - planned-novel-source-review.patch583lines, planned-focused-lock-maps.json1028lines, frozen-generated-vs-reviewed212.patch616lines, preserved-original213-human-pre-use.patch1248lines/36paths were subject to read attempts, but displayed outputs contained character truncation. Complete untruncated visible assessment is NOT established. Historical reuse qualifications remain.\n 11 - supplement-reviewed-composition.py -> immutable composition-assessment-supplement.json/.patch:18paths/1014lines, including two extra exact paths (FileFnAI index and atomic test). Corrects flawed first proposal's hard-coded consumer selection and /docs/docs URLs; replaces unimplemented FileFn MCP/raw/rich/skills assertions with coherent native-route-aware guidance. AuthFn native LLM guide restored from212, authoritative hosts aligned.\n-12 - supplement-final-guide-and-platform-assessment.py -> immutable final-guide-platform-supplement.json/.patch:3paths; correct FileFn port6006, ExtFn README public-export prerequisite ownership, explicit Windows/POSIX-mode test qualification. Final patch read without truncation.\n+16 - supplement-final-guide-and-platform-assessment.py -> immutabl