{"type":"message","id":"d6fdb5c2","parentId":"cc7a74b4","timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:35:29.164Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2af9c919b2364a188f9813f5a04df1dc|fc_055fb762f51dfcfc016ac62070f7b087d084dc89f383d93f9f","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"from pathlib import Path\np = Path('package-lock.json')\nif not p.exists():\n    print('package-lock.json: missing')\n    raise SystemExit\ndata = json.loads(p.read_text())\npackages = data.get('packages', {})\nfor key in sorted(packages):\n    if key in ('node_modules/@sveltejs/kit', 'node_modules/@docsfn/sveltekit', 'node_modules/gray-matter') or key.endswith('/docs'):\n        print(f'--- {key}')\n        print(json.dumps(packages[key], indent=2, sort_keys=True))\nPY\n\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- docs-site import declarations ---'\nrg -n '^(import|export).*(@sveltejs/kit|@docsfn/sveltekit|gray-matter|@docsfn/core)' scripts/docs-site\n```\n\nRepository: 21nCo/super-functions\n\nLength of output: 42509\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nset -eu\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- changed file and shared imports ---'\ngit diff 7c6ec512235176b1667b7c5e01193ae783003ac9 f15540d26c2329203c626ccb51eb9108c5bebd84 -- scripts/docs-site/vite.ts scripts/docs-site/page.ts scripts/docs-site/runtime.ts\nrg -n '^(import|export).*(@sveltejs/kit|@docsfn/sveltekit|gray-matter|@docsfn/core)' scripts/docs-site\n\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- docs manifests ---'\nfor f in authfn/docs/package.json filefn/docs/package.json extfn/docs/package.json package.json; do\n  if [ -f \"$f\" ]; then\n    echo \"--- $f\"\n    cat -n \"$f\"\n  fi\ndone\n\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- lockfile package records ---'\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path('package-lock.json')\nif not p.exists():\n    print('package-lock.json: missing')\n    raise SystemExit\ndata = json.loads(p.read_text())\nfor key, value in sorted(data.get('packages', {}).items()):\n    if key in ('node_modules/@sveltejs/kit', 'node_modules/@docsfn/sveltekit', 'node_modules/gray-matter') or key.endswith('/docs'):\n        print(f'--- {key}')\n        print(json.dumps(value, indent=2, sort_keys=True))\nPY\n```\n\nRepository: 21nCo/super-functions\n\nLength of output: 42481\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nset -eu\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- docs-site Vite configuration and plugin usage ---'\nrg -n -C 8 'docsSiteCorePlugin|scripts/docs-site/vite|resolve:|alias:|dedupe:' \\\n  authfn filefn extfn scripts -g 'vite.config.*' -g '*.config.*' -g '!**/node_modules/**'\n\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- relevant lockfile paths ---'\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\ndata = json.loads(Path('package-lock.json').read_text())\npackages = data.get('packages', {})\nfor key in sorted(packages):\n    if any(token in key for token in (\n        '@docsfn/core', '@docsfn/sveltekit', '@sveltejs/kit', 'gray-matter'\n    )):\n        print(key)\n        value = packages[key]\n        if isinstance(value, dict):\n            print('  version=', value.get('version'), 'resolved=', value.get('resolved'),\n                  'link=', value.get('link'), 'dependencies=', value.get('dependencies'),\n                  'peerDependencies=', value.get('peerDependencies'))\nPY\n```\n\nRepository: 21nCo/super-functions\n\nLength of output: 22870\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nset -eu\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- runtime consumers ---'\nrg -n -C 4 'createDocsSiteRuntime|loadDocsSiteSource|from [\"'\\''].*scripts/docs-site/runtime|from [\"'\\''].*docs-site/runtime|from [\"'\\'']\\./runtime[\"'\\'']' \\\n  authfn filefn extfn scripts -g '*.ts' -g '*.js' -g '*.svelte' -g '*.mjs' -g '!**/node_modules/**'\n\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- docs-site runtime tests ---'\nsed -n '1,80p' scripts/docs-site/runtime.test.ts\n```\n\nRepository: 21nCo/super-functions\n\nLength of output: 26673\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Declare `gray-matter` in the AuthFn and FileFn docs workspaces.**\n\n[118 more lines in file. Use offset=1201 to 